{"version": 3, "posts": [{"event_id": "legacy:388621159811578", "title": "743,250 Sun Communities, Inc. $SUI Shares Bought by Aberdeen Group plc", "text": "MarketBeat recently reported that Aberdeen Group plc acquired 743,250 shares of Sun Communities, Inc., though investors should verify how this institutional filing relates to $SUI exposure. Currently trading at 0.7206 USDT, down 1.06% over the past 24 hours, the token's broader market reception remains mixed amid shifting sentiment. Observers should monitor whether traditional financial reporting accurately reflects underlying digital asset allocations or simply corporate name overlaps.", "symbol": "SUI", "coin_id": "legacy-reviewed", "reserved_at": "2026-11-15T19:03:32.9710828Z", "published_at": "2026-11-15T19:03:32.9710828Z", "status": "published", "post_id": "388621159811578", "url": "https://www.binance.com/square/post/388621159811578", "kind": "LEGACY", "hook": null, "score": 0, "media": {"original": true}, "sources": []}, {"event_id": "legacy:388621439006103", "title": "NEAR Protocol price rises 5.5% in 4 hours despi...", "text": "Pluang recently reported that NEAR Protocol ($NEAR) climbed 5.5% over a four-hour window, while current Binance Spot data shows a more modest 24-hour gain of 1.29% at $3.143. Investors should remember that short-term price movements and interesting headline signals rarely equal a proven, long-term market trend. Distinguishing between fleeting momentum and sustained structural shifts helps prevent impulsive decisions.", "symbol": "NEAR", "coin_id": "legacy-reviewed", "reserved_at": "2026-11-15T19:04:41.1249595Z", "published_at": "2026-11-15T19:04:41.1249595Z", "status": "published", "post_id": "388621439006103", "url": "https://www.binance.com/square/post/388621439006103", "kind": "LEGACY", "hook": null, "score": 0, "media": {"original": true}, "sources": []}, {"event_id": "legacy:388621715825046", "title": "Bitway Falls 20.76% as 71 of 89 Large Crypto Assets Decline", "text": "Whi